+ *      are not.
+ *   6. The extracted plugin.json MUST declare the same id and version as the
+ *      registry entry.
+ *   7. The destination directory (src/plugins/community/{id}) MUST NOT
+ *      already exist — installs never overwrite. Use uninstall then install.
